cedia adapts code from the following sources:

- pstack-claude (MIT) — pi/ subagent machinery adapted into src/task/ (agents.ts, agent-tools.ts, child.ts, worktree.ts, agent-text.ts, sleep-wait.ts, config.ts). Copyright (c) pstack-claude authors.
- Grok Build (Apache-2.0) — auto_mode_classifier_system_prompt.md, goal_*_prompt.md adapted for gate classifier and goal mode.
- Codex (Apache-2.0) — compaction prompt and model capability registry concepts.

Claude Code (no license) — read only for understanding; no code copied.

- oh-my-pi (MIT) — web search chain shape (ordered providers with availability checks, accumulated failures, shared response envelope) adapted into src/websearch.ts and src/websearch-providers.ts. Provider request code was not copied.

- harness2 (Apache-2.0) — budget ledger identity (R rollouts + P sessions per task) adapted into scripts/scoreboard.mjs. Executor, benchmark, and recursion code were not copied.
